  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      106.32,
      359.9,
      286.48,
      375.84
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No: \u0dd9\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dca/\u0db4\u0dd9\u0daf\u0dca/\u0d89\u0d85\u0dad\u0dca/98/5 (11)",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.019999980926514,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      376.21,
      286.57,
      445.94
    ],
    "text": "Land Ministry Ref No: LD/05/2006/E/191. I, hereby give notice under sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the land Acquisition Act that the Government intends to acquire the following land for the CH/Wen/st. Rita (Thaldeka) Primary School.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.019999980926514,
      7.019999980926514,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      446.35,
      286.53,
      602.34
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired: An allotment of land called Madangahawaththa in total extent of 0.2020 Hectare depicted as lot No. 1 in Preliminary plan No: p.p.pu. 4950 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in the village of Thaldeka Kammal Paththawa Province Minor division in the Divisional Secreary's Division of Wennappuwa in Puttlam District North Western province. Lot No. 1 Name of the land: Madangahawaththa; Propose: for the CH/Wen/st. Rita (Thaldeka) Primary School; Claimant: H.A. D. M.M. Irangani; Extent: 0.2020 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      330.25,
      539.52,
      456.3
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing. before me at Divisional Secretariat Wennappuwa on the 08th day of April, 2015 at 10.30am and are heeby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicates) on or before the 01st day of April, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      456.73,
      518.69,
      571.32
    ],
    "text": "U. S. N. FERNANDO, Disisional Secretary, Wennappuwa. Divisional Secretariat, Wennappuwa. 23rd February, 2015. 04 - 45",
